<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= typeof pageTitle !== 'undefined' ? pageTitle : 'Navchetna Yuva Mahotsav - Event Guidelines & Schedule' %></title>
  <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <!-- Google Fonts for Hindi and English -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Mukta:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', 'Mukta', sans-serif;
    }
    .hindi-text {
      font-family: 'Mukta', sans-serif;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-900 antialiased min-h-screen">

  <!-- Header Banner -->
  <header class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-600 via-orange-600 to-red-600 text-white shadow-lg sticky top-0 z-50">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-6 text-center">
      <span class="inline-block bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm text-xs md:text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-2">
        Official Guidelines & Regulations
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">प्रतियोगिता नियम व समय-सारणी</h1>
      <p class="text-orange-100 text-sm md:text-base mt-2 font-medium">Navchetna Yuva Mahotsav 2026 • Event Schedule & Rulebook</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-10 space-y-12">

    <!-- Day 1: 03 October 2026 -->
    <section>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b-2 border-orange-500 pb-3 mb-6">
        <span class="bg-orange-600 text-white font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-md text-sm">DAY 1</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-800">03 October 2026</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">

        <!-- Rangotsav Junior Card -->
        <article class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition">
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-500 to-rose-500 text-white p-4 flex justify-between items-center">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">🎨 Rangotsav / रंगोत्सव</h3>
              <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-rose-100 font-semibold">Junior Category (Classes 7th - 12th & 4th - 6th)</p>
            </div>
            <span class="bg-white/20 text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold">9:00 AM - 10:00 AM</span>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 space-y-4">
            <div class="bg-rose-50 border-l-4 border-rose-500 p-3 rounded-r-md">
              <p class="text-sm font-bold text-rose-900">विषय / Topics:</p>
              <ul class="text-xs text-rose-800 mt-1 space-y-1 list-disc list-inside">
                <li><strong>Class 7th - 12th:</strong> स्वच्छ भारत / Clean India</li>
                <li><strong>Class 4th, 5th, 6th:</strong> Any Open Topic (कक्षा 4, 5, 6 के लिए कोई निर्धारित विषय नहीं है, किसी भी टॉपिक पर बना सकते हैं)</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-rose-500 font-bold">•</span>
                <div><strong>Duration / समय:</strong> 1 Hour (समय 1 घंटा)</div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-rose-500 font-bold">•</span>
                <div><strong>Evaluation / जजमेंट:</strong> Innovative, authentic, and creative approach (इनोवेटिव, ऑथेंटिक और क्रिएटिविटी).</div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-rose-500 font-bold">•</span>
                <div><strong>Materials / सामग्री:</strong> Sheet provided by institution. Bring own colors, water bottle, and exam pad. (ड्रॉइंग शीट संस्था द्वारा दी जाएगी; रंग, पानी की बोतल व पैड स्वयं लाएं).</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Lok Nritya Card -->
        <article class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition">
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-yellow-500 text-white p-4 flex justify-between items-center">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">💃 Lok Nritya / लोक नृत्य</h3>
              <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-100 font-semibold">Folk & Cultural Dance</p>
            </div>
            <span class="bg-white/20 text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold">10:00 AM - 4:00 PM</span>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 space-y-4">
            <div class="bg-amber-50 border-l-4 border-amber-500 p-3 rounded-r-md">
              <p class="text-sm font-bold text-amber-900">विषय / Theme:</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-amber-800 mt-1">
                Indian Culture with preference to folk dances of Madhya Pradesh (भारतीय संस्कृति व मध्य प्रदेश के लोक नृत्यों को विशेष प्राथमिकता).
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-amber-500 font-bold">•</span>
                <div><strong>Time Limit / समय सीमा:</strong> Strictly 3 Minutes (अधिकतम 3 मिनट).</div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-amber-500 font-bold">•</span>
                <div><strong>Audio Track / म्यूज़िक:</strong> Bring music track loaded in a <strong>Pen Drive</strong>. Non-antisocial Bollywood tracks permitted.</div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-amber-500 font-bold">•</span>
                <div><strong>Arrangements / व्यवस्था:</strong> Dedicated green rooms available for costume change (boys & girls). Bring own water bottles.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Day 2: 04 October 2026 -->
    <section>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b-2 border-indigo-500 pb-3 mb-6">
        <span class="bg-indigo-600 text-white font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-md text-sm">DAY 2</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-800">04 October 2026</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">

        <!-- Rangotsav Senior Card -->
        <article class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition">
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-indigo-600 text-white p-4 flex justify-between items-center">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">🎨 Rangotsav / रंगोत्सव</h3>
              <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-indigo-100 font-semibold">Senior Category (UG & PG College)</p>
            </div>
            <span class="bg-white/20 text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold">9:00 AM - 10:00 AM</span>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 space-y-4">
            <div class="bg-purple-50 border-l-4 border-purple-500 p-3 rounded-r-md">
              <p class="text-sm font-bold text-purple-900">विषय / Topic:</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-purple-800 mt-1 font-semibold">
                Mental Health & Youth / मानसिक स्वास्थ्य और युवा
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-purple-600 font-bold">•</span>
                <div><strong>Duration / समय:</strong> 1 Hour (समय 1 घंटा).</div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-purple-600 font-bold">•</span>
                <div><strong>Judgment / मानदंड:</strong> Innovation, Authenticity & Creativity.</div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-purple-600 font-bold">•</span>
                <div><strong>Supplies / सामग्री:</strong> Drawing sheet provided on-site. Bring own color kit, exam board, and drinking water.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Yuva Vani Open Mic Card -->
        <article class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition">
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-cyan-600 text-white p-4 flex justify-between items-center">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">🎤 Yuva Vani / युवा वाणी</h3>
              <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-cyan-100 font-semibold">Open Mic & Oratory</p>
            </div>
            <span class="bg-white/20 text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold">10:00 AM - 4:00 PM</span>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 space-y-4">
            <div class="bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 p-3 rounded-r-md">
              <p class="text-sm font-bold text-blue-900">प्रारूप व नियम / Format & Conduct:</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-blue-800 mt-1">
                Strictly <strong>No Debating format</strong>. Avoid criticism and negative points (नकारात्मकता और अनावश्यक आलोचना से बचें).
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-blue-500 font-bold">•</span>
                <div><strong>Time & Language:</strong> 3 Minutes max. Spoken in Hindi or English (हिन्दी व अंग्रेजी).</div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-blue-500 font-bold">•</span>
                <div><strong>Rules:</strong> Reading from devices or papers is strictly prohibited (याद करके बोलना होगा).</div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-blue-500 font-bold">•</span>
                <div><strong>Judging Criteria:</strong> Evaluated on content strength and delivery style. Bring personal water bottles.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- General Morning Competitions (Essay & Quizzes) -->
    <section>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b-2 border-emerald-500 pb-3 mb-6">
        <span class="bg-emerald-600 text-white font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-md text-sm">MORNING SESSIONS</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-800">Essay Writing & Quizzes / निबंध व प्रश्नोत्तरी</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">

        <!-- Junior Essay Card -->
        <article class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-5 space-y-4">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">✍️ Essay Writing / निबंध लेखन (Junior)</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-semibold">Classes 7th to 12th</p>
            </div>
            <span class="bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full font-bold">8:00 AM - 9:00 AM</span>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-emerald-50 rounded-lg p-3 text-xs text-emerald-900 space-y-1">
            <span class="font-bold">विषय विकल्प / Select Any 1 Topic:</span>
            <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-0.5 pt-1">
              <li>स्वच्छ भारत / Clean India</li>
              <li>नशा मुक्त भारत / Drug-Free India</li>
            </ol>
          </div>

          <ul class="text-xs text-slate-600 space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside">
            <li><strong>Word Limit / शब्द सीमा:</strong> 250 words (250 शब्द).</li>
            <li><strong>Time Limit:</strong> 1 Hour (1 घंटा).</li>
            <li><strong>Medium:</strong> Hindi or English (हिंदी अथवा अंग्रेजी).</li>
            <li>Answer sheets provided by organizers; bring exam pad and pen.</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <!-- Senior Essay Card -->
        <article class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-5 space-y-4">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">✍️ Essay Writing / निबंध लेखन (Senior)</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-semibold">Undergraduate & Postgraduate (UG - PG)</p>
            </div>
            <span class="bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full font-bold">8:00 AM - 9:00 AM</span>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-emerald-50 rounded-lg p-3 text-xs text-emerald-900 space-y-1">
            <span class="font-bold">विषय विकल्प / Select Any 1 Topic:</span>
            <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-0.5 pt-1">
              <li>मानसिक स्वास्थ्य और सामाजिक प्रभाव / Mental Health & Social Impact</li>
              <li>कुटुंब प्रबोधन: एक मजबूत पारिवारिक संरचना / Family Enlightenment: A Strong Family Structure</li>
            </ol>
          </div>

          <ul class="text-xs text-slate-600 space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside">
            <li><strong>Word Limit / शब्द सीमा:</strong> 500 words (500 शब्द).</li>
            <li><strong>Time Limit:</strong> 1 Hour (1 घंटा).</li>
            <li><strong>Medium:</strong> Hindi or English (हिंदी अथवा अंग्रेजी).</li>
            <li>Writing copies provided by organizers; carry pen and exam pad.</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <!-- Bharat Bodh Quiz Card -->
        <article class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-5 space-y-4">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">📖 Bharat Bodh / भारत बोध (GK Quiz)</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-semibold">General Knowledge & MP Special</p>
            </div>
            <span class="bg-sky-100 text-sky-800 text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full font-bold">8:00 AM - 9:00 AM</span>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-sky-50 rounded-lg p-3 text-xs text-sky-900 space-y-1">
            <span class="font-bold">सिलेबस / Syllabus:</span>
            <p>Madhya Pradesh history, geography, current affairs, and Indian modern history (मध्य प्रदेश का इतिहास, भूगोल, समसामयिकी व आधुनिक भारतीय इतिहास).</p>
          </div>

          <ul class="text-xs text-slate-600 space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside">
            <li><strong>Pattern:</strong> 50 Questions to be solved in 30 Minutes (50 प्रश्न, 30 मिनट).</li>
            <li><strong>Marking:</strong> <strong>No Negative Marking</strong> (कोई नकारात्मक अंकन नहीं).</li>
            <li>Unfair means strictly prohibited. Bring own pen, water bottle, and pad.</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <!-- Dharma Gatha Quiz Card -->
        <article class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-5 space-y-4">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">📖 Dharma Gatha / धर्म गाथा (Epics Quiz)</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-semibold">Indian Itihasa & Scriptures</p>
            </div>
            <span class="bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full font-bold">8:00 AM - 9:00 AM</span>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-amber-50 rounded-lg p-3 text-xs text-amber-900 space-y-1">
            <span class="font-bold">सिलेबस / Syllabus:</span>
            <p>Questions related to Ramayana & Mahabharata (रामायण और महाभारत से संबंधित प्रश्न).</p>
          </div>

          <ul class="text-xs text-slate-600 space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside">
            <li><strong>Pattern:</strong> 50 Questions in 30 Minutes (50 प्रश्न, 30 मिनट).</li>
            <li><strong>Marking:</strong> <strong>No Negative Marking</strong> (ऋणात्मक मूल्यांकन नहीं).</li>
            <li>Strict anti-cheating protocol. Bring pen, water bottle, and exam board.</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- General Instructions Callout -->
    <div class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-md">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-400 mb-2">📌 सामान्य निर्देश / General Instructions for All Participants</h3>
      <ul class="text-sm text-slate-300 space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside">
        <li>All participants must arrive at the venue at least 30 minutes prior to their event slot.</li>
        <li>Drawing sheets and essay copies will be distributed directly at the desks.</li>
        <li>Personal stationery (pens, colors, drawing pads/exam boards) and drinking water bottles are mandatory to carry.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

  </main>

  <footer class="bg-slate-900 border-t border-slate-800 text-center py-6 text-xs text-slate-500">
    <p>© 2026 Navchetna Yuva Mahotsav. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
